# Optional. Where a booking request is POSTed as JSON (n8n, Zapier, Formspree,
# a Vercel function...). Leave unset and the site still works: the confirmation
# screen hands the customer a one-tap SMS / email carrying the same summary.
VITE_BOOKING_ENDPOINT=

# Optional. Only read when BOOKING.mode === 'calcom' in src/config.js.
# Format: "user/event-slug"
VITE_CALCOM_LINK=
